  <section class="wrap fiche-body">
    <div>
      <h2>The vibe</h2>
      <p>On the Plage du Débarquement in La Croix-Valmer, in the Gulf of Saint-Tropez, Nautic Beach is a beach restaurant facing the Îles d'Or. Its official website describes traditional Mediterranean cuisine prepared by chef Marco, a dessert menu and house cocktails. A snack bar completes the offer, with crêpes, ice cream and waffles, and the restaurant presents itself as a feet-in-the-sand address, between sea and pine forest, in the heart of the Port-Cros national park.</p>

      <h2>With your dog</h2>
      <p>The tourist office listings (Provence-Alpes-Côte d'Azur Tourisme, Côte d'Azur France, Grimaud Tourisme, Golfe de Saint-Tropez Destination) all list "Animals accepted" among the restaurant's services, next to the terrace and nearby parking. The restaurant's own website does not detail this welcome: ask the team where to settle your dog, for example on the terrace or in the shade, and whether a water bowl is possible.</p>
      <div class="callout">Coco's tip: the tourist offices say the restaurant accepts animals, but the beach is another question: see the "Check before you come" box before taking your dog there to swim.</div>

      <h2>Practical information</h2>
      <p>The restaurant is at 32 route de la plage du Débarquement. The official website announces opening every day, with lunch service all year and evening service in the summer season. The tourist offices give a capacity of 210 seats, a sea view, prices from €14 to €32, payment by meal vouchers and Chèque-Vacances, and independent wheelchair access. The team speaks Italian, English and French according to Golfe de Saint-Tropez Destination. Phone: +33 (0)4 94 79 61 55.</p>

      <h2>Nearby</h2>
      <p>The Plage du Débarquement is in the commune of La Croix-Valmer, within the Port-Cros national park perimeter according to the restaurant's website. A shuttle stop is signposted less than 300 metres away and a public transport stop less than 500 metres away.</p>
    </div>

